    "text_and_images_blocks_rYrmMd": {
      "type": "text-and-images-blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "text_9GMHHV": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>“We’ve leveraged years, and I mean years, of customer feedback. This shoe is almost designed by you, the TRUE faithful, and we couldn’t be more excited for you to experience the future of natural comfort.\"<\/h4>",
            "text_block_width": 1000
          }
        },
        "text_yi79gM": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Jason Moore | TRUE CEO & Co-Founder<\/strong><\/p>",
            "text_block_width": 1440
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_9GMHHV",
        "text_yi79gM"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "bg_color": "#ffffff",
        "text_color": "#070707",
        "text_align": "center",
        "banner_position": "left"
      }
    },
    "text_and_images_blocks_b9DrjY": {
      "type": "text-and-images-blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "image_ceRh6z": {
          "type": "image",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Mask_Group_91.png"
          }
        },
        "text_rk4wdc": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h6>LEVELING UP THE ORIGINAL EXPERIENCE AFTER MILLIONS OF STEPS<\/h6>",
            "text_block_width": 500
          }
        },
        "text_WpiPTM": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We launched our Original Series in 2017 that brought the first extra-wide, zero drop golf shoe to courses worldwide. Since then, we’ve released multiple iterations of the Original - the OG1.2, OG Feel, OG Premium, OG Tour; you get the idea. After hearing from Tour professionals, customers, and employees we knew we needed to bring a new experience that mimicked the fan-favorite zero drop, wide toe box feel that was so loved - but with added comfort and versatility. The OG Cush is 7+ years in the making. A first of its kind cushioned zero drop shoe that allows you to enjoy the walk naturally and comfortably.<\/p>",
            "text_block_width": 600
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "image_ceRh6z",
        "text_rk4wdc",
        "text_WpiPTM"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "bg_color": "#f9f9f9",
        "text_color": "#070707",
        "text_align": "left",
        "banner": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Shot3_6fc44d33-25ad-492e-ad66-c03466e8d4a9.png",
        "banner_position": "left"
      }
    },
    "text_and_images_blocks_WWRbfL": {
      "type": "text-and-images-blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "image_PUwpPd": {
          "type": "image",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Mask_Group_10.png"
          }
        },
        "text_gqrYLy": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h6>A FIRST OF ITS KIND: a Zero drop cushioned platform<\/h6>",
            "text_block_width": 500
          }
        },
        "text_ffKj3R": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The OG Cush marries a barefoot feel with maximum comfort. The new cushioned midsole also features a brand-new tread that improves traction, balance and stability while maintaining its signature comfort. The zero drop, wide toe box experience feels like you’re walking barefoot with the added benefit of having some cushioning underfoot. The new tread performs well in any environment - from the course to the trail, the streets, or even at the office. The OG Cush is designed to look like a modern shoe while providing unrivaled comfort and cushioning in every step.<\/p>",
            "text_block_width": 600
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "image_PUwpPd",
        "text_gqrYLy",
        "text_ffKj3R"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "bg_color": "#f9f9f9",
        "text_color": "#070707",
        "text_align": "right",
        "banner": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Shot1_2b6455f7-4206-4021-ab66-5bfe9b854003.png",
        "banner_position": "right"
      }
    },
    "text_and_images_blocks_htxWHJ": {
      "type": "text-and-images-blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "image_RrqtHW": {
          "type": "image",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Mask_Group_11.png"
          }
        },
        "text_YaBqrt": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h6>ERGONOMIC DESIGN SO YOU FORGET YOU'RE WEARING SHOES<\/h6>",
            "text_block_width": 500
          }
        },
        "text_R8YiGg": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Arguably the best OG sensation? Forgetting you're even wearing shoes. With 200,000+ pairs of Originals sold, we’ve had time to compile feedback from customers and TOUR golfers alike. The overwhelming response? You wanted to keep the distinct anatomical shaping, wide toe box and add just a little more cushioning for all day comfort. With an added 6MM of Wanderlux midsole cushioning while maintaining the same barefoot feel - the OG Cush is praised by golfers and podiatrists alike for being a true natural golf shoe.<\/p>",
            "text_block_width": 780
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "image_RrqtHW",
        "text_YaBqrt",
        "text_R8YiGg"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "bg_color": "#f9f9f9",
        "text_color": "#070707",
        "text_align": "left",
        "banner": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Shot2_92c4b5f1-2f4a-4fa1-8fb1-0da9e75bb286.png",
        "banner_position": "left"
      }
    },
